kwin-tabgroups (0.3.0-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release
  [Upstream]
  - simplify where the tab strip is placed
    - share the code for a tab leaving its group
    - remove data and checks nothing uses
    - don't drop a group when the system cancels a strip drag
    - never group with a window without a title from the keyboard either
    - apply changed settings to every group
    - don't leave the grouping prompt behind
    - never rebuild a saved group from a window that is already a tab
    - stop un-hiding windows the application hid itself
    - keep working after the script is turned off and on again

